        },
        "data_year": 2019
      },
      {
        "id": "URY-problems-003",
        "statement": "The health ministry's accounts tie the rise in spending executed by the ministry to growing court injunctions (recursos de amparo) for benefits outside the coverage, which the ministry had to pay, and report that this spending was four times its 2005 level in 2024.",
